        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 2:31PM EDT until September 27 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Caribou ME</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 25 to 35 kt with gusts up to 45 kt and
seas 10 to 15 ft expected.

* WHERE...Waters from Eastport ME to Schoodic Point ME from 25
to 60 NM or the Hague Line and Waters from Schoodic Point ME
to Stonington ME from 25 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...From 11 AM Friday to 8 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should alter plans to avoid these hazardous conditions.
Remain in port, seek safe harbor, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for hazardous conditions.</instruction>
